  "guide": "`atomicCounterexampleRepresentation` is $\\rho_0$. `SelectedAtomicHilbert completedRootPureState` is $\\mathcal H$; `completedRootPureState` is $\\omega$ bundled with its purity proof. The right-hand side specializes `shellFamilyInclusion` to the same family. The map $\\iota$ is explained through the separately cited source-map declaration.",
